        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "7830f58a-2891-5441-addb-0897e04bff89",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Son of the Pink Panther, The Return of the Pink Panther, A Shot in the Dark, Inspector Clouseau, Down by Law, Night on Earth, Coffee and Cigarettes\n- People: Herbert Lom, Burt Kwouk, Graham Stark, Claudia Cardinale, Roberto Benigni, Jim Jarmusch, Peter Sellers\n- Concepts: The Pink Panther film series, Inspector Clouseau, Cato\n\nFacts:\n- A Shot in the Dark was released in 1964 and featured Inspector Clouseau before Peter Sellers returned to the role later.\n- Inspector Clouseau was released in 1968 after Peter Sellers declined to reprise the role of Inspector Clouseau in that film.\n- The Return of the Pink Panther stars Peter Sellers returning to the role of Inspector Clouseau for the first time since A Shot in the Dark.\n- Down by Law was released in 1986 and was one of three Jim Jarmusch films featuring Roberto Benigni.\n- Night on Earth was released in 1991 and was one of three Jim Jarmusch films featuring Roberto Benigni.\n- Son of the Pink Panther was released in 1993 as a continuation of The Pink Panther film series.\n- Son of the Pink Panther includes Herbert Lom, Burt Kwouk, Graham Stark, and Claudia Cardinale in its cast.\n- Roberto Benigni portrayed Inspector Clouseau's son in Son of the Pink Panther.\n- Burt Kwouk was a British actor born in 1930 and died in 2016, and he was known for playing Cato in the Pink Panther films.\n- Coffee and Cigarettes was released in 2003 and was one of three Jim Jarmusch films featuring Roberto Benigni.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
        "original_id": "0d2c9ae3-0a2c-51aa-af2f-37d01f7381c0",
        "text": "Page: Son of the Pink Panther. Sentence: Son of the Pink Panther (1993) is a continuation of \"The Pink Panther\" film series.\nPage: Son of the Pink Panther. Sentence: Also in this film are \"Panther\" regulars Herbert Lom, Burt Kwouk and Graham Stark and a star of the original 1963 film, Claudia Cardinale.\nPage: Burt Kwouk. Sentence: Herbert Tsangtse \"Burt\" Kwouk, OBE ( ; ; 18 July 1930 – 24 May 2016) was a British actor, known for his role as Cato in the \"Pink Panther\" films.\nPage: Roberto Benigni. Sentence: He also portrayed Inspector Clouseau's son in \"Son of the Pink Panther\" (1993) and has collaborated with filmmaker Jim Jarmusch in three of his films: \"Down by Law\" (1986), \"Night on Earth\" (1991) and \"Coffee and Cigarettes\" (2003).\nPage: The Return of the Pink Panther. Sentence: The film stars Peter Sellers, returning to the role of Inspector Clouseau, for the first time since \"A Shot in the Dark\" (1964), after having declined to reprise the role in \"Inspector Clouseau\" (1968).",
        "type": "DocumentChunk"
      },
